<title>USA: HMT Technology sees lower Q3 net.</title>
<headline>HMT Technology sees lower Q3 net.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>HMT Technology Corp said it expects to report third quarter net income of about $13 million, or $0.30 per share, on sales of about $61.2 million.</p>
<p>It said the per share income was based on 44.2 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>In the year ago third quarter, the company said it reported net income of $19.5 million, or $0.56 per share, on 34.8 million shares outstanding; and revenues of $56.3 million.</p>
</text>
